The files gp_example_enhancer_links.tsv and
gp_example_enhancer_coordinates.tsv contain two records selected from the
PANTHER PEREGRINE version 19 enhancer-gene links and hg38 enhancer coordinates.

Source files:
https://data.pantherdb.org/ftp/peregrine_data/enhancer_gene_link_19.tsv
https://data.pantherdb.org/ftp/peregrine_data/PEREGRINEenhancershg38

The records overlap the first two peak coordinates in gp_example_inputs and
link them to TTLL10 and SAMD11, respectively. They are included so package
examples and vignettes can execute without network access.
